# OpenOrc product SPA (apps/app) environment (draft)
#
# Copy to apps/app/.env and fill in real values:
#
#   cp apps/app/.env.example apps/app/.env
#
# - apps/app/.env is git-ignored and must never be committed.
# - Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed variables to the client bundle.
# - Never put real secrets in VITE_* variables: anyone who can load the SPA
#   can read everything exposed through them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenOrc API
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Absolute http(s) base URL of the OpenOrc API, for example
# http://127.0.0.1:3000 in local development.
#
# Invariant: the SPA never assumes it is served by the API process and never
# falls back silently to same-origin behavior. An unset or invalid value
# fails closed when the application needs the API base URL.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=